###  https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/NIOSH-ControlOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/NIOSH-ControlOntology#PersonalProtectiveEquipment> rdf:type owl:Class ;
